.TH cc 1
.SH NAME
cc \- Compile sources
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcc\fR [\fB\-I\fR|\fB\-\-include\fR \fIINCLUDE\fR] [\fB\-O\fR|\fB\-\-opt\fR \fIOPT\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILANGUAGE\fR> <\fISOURCES\fR>... [\-\- \fILINKER\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compile sources
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
<\fILANGUAGE\fR>
Target language
.sp
[\fIpossible values: \fRc, c++]
.TP
<\fISOURCES\fR>...
Source files
.sp
[\fIpossible values: \fRmain.c, util.c]
.TP
[\fILINKER\fR]...
Linker arguments
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-I\fR, \fB\-\-include\fR=\fIINCLUDE\fR
Header directories
.TP
\fB\-O\fR, \fB\-\-opt\fR=\fIOPT\fR
Optimization level
.sp
[\fIpossible values: \fR0, 1, 2, 3]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
